# Canonical author/committer identity for this repository.
#
# A .mailmap folds commits made under variant names/emails into one display
# identity for `git shortlog`, `git log --use-mailmap`, `git blame`, and
# GitHub's contributor graph — without rewriting history.
#
# The history was normalized to this identity on 2026-05-30 (a one-time
# rewrite of pre-public commits). These entries guard against future drift
# (e.g. a new machine with a different `git config user.name`).
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  [Commit Name] <commit@email>
Thomas Powers <manehorizons@gmail.com> <manehorizons@gmail.com>
Thomas Powers <manehorizons@gmail.com> nullrook <manehorizons@gmail.com>
Thomas Powers <manehorizons@gmail.com> Mane Horizons <manehorizons@gmail.com>
